    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/08845af9a55995bc922c357a6859a4d8.poster.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/08845af9a55995bc922c357a6859a4d8.webm?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/08845af9a55995bc922c357a6859a4d8.mp4?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Undead Trail: Haunting Shadow</strong> is an immersive horror side-scroller that takes players into a haunted mansion filled with secrets and dangers at every turn.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/594ce95fef6ade6563a25e443be11b49.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/1faf211c66c3dc00004d734dbee22db8.poster.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/1faf211c66c3dc00004d734dbee22db8.webm?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/1faf211c66c3dc00004d734dbee22db8.mp4?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Prepare to confront your deepest fears</strong>. Every sound will give you goosebumps, making it a scary adventure you won't forget. Wear headphones for the full effect and be ready!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/274d6c9d99866b2c7756e9ef0fe7499f.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/94d5fc384451bc95fcc49cc45f1f4469.poster.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/94d5fc384451bc95fcc49cc45f1f4469.webm?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/94d5fc384451bc95fcc49cc45f1f4469.mp4?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you make your way through the mansion's sinister halls, you'll encounter all kinds of undead creatures, from regular zombies to massive giants and lightning-fast foes. Each encounter will challenge your survival instincts, demanding quick reflexes and smart strategies to make it through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/3f366509ab56ad2546716be6c5ed3ce8.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/3bcfea4c284aa297d38a58bbba230556.poster.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/3bcfea4c284aa297d38a58bbba230556.webm?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/3bcfea4c284aa297d38a58bbba230556.mp4?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Prepare yourself for intense battles against swarms of zombies! You'll have a variety of weapons at your disposal, each with its own unique abilities to help you fight off the undead. Whether you prefer a stealthy approach, sneaking past zombies undetected, or setting up clever traps like bear traps to catch them off guard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/6f7727ab0b2bcd733940c9bd9a035850.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><br>Undead Trail: Haunting Shadow is a passion project crafted by a single developer, pouring heart, soul, and many sleepless nights into the game. Get involved in the development process by talking directly with the developer on Discord and engage in discussions with other community members.<br><br>Welcome to <strong>Undead Trail: Haunting Shadow</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/e02f022389a7ea830e265752255310c1.poster.avif?t=1737791007\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/e02f022389a7ea830e265752255310c1.webm?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976410/extras/e02f022389a7ea830e265752255310c1.mp4?t=1737791007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
